<title>FINLAND: ENSTO SAYS PAID FIM 42 MLN FOR REST OF SALOPLAST.</title>
<headline>ENSTO SAYS PAID FIM 42 MLN FOR REST OF SALOPLAST.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish electrical equipment maker Oy Ensto Ab said in a statement on Thursday it had paid 42.3 million markka for the remaining 48 percent of Saloplast through which its stake in Saloplast rose to 100 percent.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
